{{en-adj|cozier|coziest}}

# Affording [[comfort]] and [[warmth]]; snug; social
#*'''1785''', [[w:Robert Burns|Robert Burns]], ''Holy Fair'' - While some are '''cozie''' i' the neuk, / An' forming assignations / To meet some day

